---
import { getEntry, render } from "astro:content";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import TableOfContents from "@/components/TableOfContents.astro";
import Tools from "@/components/Tools.astro";
import SocialNetworks from "@/components/SocialNetworks.astro";
import config from "@/config";

const about = await getEntry("pages", "about");
const aboutZh = await getEntry("pages", "about-zh");

if (!about) {
  throw new Error(
    "Missing content entry: `about.md` or `about.mdx` in `src/content/pages/`"
  );
}

const { Content, headings } = await render(about);
// Chinese version, shown when the language switch is set to 中文. This page and
// the homepage bio are the only two places that differ between languages.
const ZhContent = aboutZh ? (await render(aboutZh)).Content : Content;
---

<Layout
  title={`${about.data.title} | ${config.site.title}`}
  description={about.data.description}
  ogImage={about.data.ogImage}
  canonicalURL={about.data.canonicalURL}
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout-wide py-8" data-pagefind-body>
    <div class="md:flex md:items-start md:gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      <div class="mx-auto min-w-0 w-full max-w-3xl md:mx-0 md:grow">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium sm:text-4xl">About</h1>

        <div id="article" class="app-prose mt-8 w-full max-w-none">
          {/* 首段自我介绍：没有小标题（与 axi404 的 about 一致）。 */}
          <div data-lang-en>
            <p>Hi, I&#39;m Master — an undergraduate majoring in Artificial Intelligence at Xi&#39;an Jiaotong University.</p>
            <p>I was in the 2023 cohort of the Youth Class at XJTU.</p>
            <p>My main research interests lie in VLA / WAM / SNN.</p>
            <p>I have plenty of hobbies.</p>
            <p>I like Go, classical music, films, F1 and Rusty Lake.</p>
            <p>This is my CV — feel free to download it.</p>
            <a
              href="/cv.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="not-prose group mt-2 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-foreground/20 hover:bg-muted/80 hover:text-foreground"
            >
              <svg
                class="size-5"
                width="22"
                height="22"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
                set:html={`<g fill="none"><path d="m12.593 23.258l-.011.002l-.071.035l-.02.004l-.014-.004l-.071-.035q-.016-.005-.024.005l-.004.01l-.017.428l.005.02l.01.013l.104.074l.015.004l.012-.004l.104-.074l.012-.016l.004-.017l-.017-.427q-.004-.016-.017-.018m.265-.113l-.013.002l-.185.093l-.01.01l-.003.011l.018.43l.005.012l.008.007l.201.093q.019.005.029-.008l.004-.014l-.034-.614q-.005-.018-.02-.022m-.715.002a.02.02 0 0 0-.027.006l-.006.014l-.034.614q.001.018.017.024l.015-.002l.201-.093l.01-.008l.004-.011l.017-.43l-.003-.012l-.01-.01z"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a1 1 0 0 1 .993.883L13 3v10.586l2.293-2.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.32-.083l.094.083a1 1 0 0 1 .083 1.32l-.083.094l-4 4a1 1 0 0 1-1.32.083l-.094-.083l-4-4a1 1 0 0 1 1.32-1.497l.094.083L11 13.586V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1M5 18a1 1 0 0 1 .993.883L6 19v1a1 1 0 0 0 .883.993L7 21h10a1 1 0 0 0 .993-.883L18 20v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1.993-.117L20 19v1a3 3 0 0 1-2.824 2.995L17 23H7a3 3 0 0 1-2.995-2.824L4 20v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1"/></g>`}
              />
              <span>Download CV</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div data-lang-zh>
            <p>你好哇，我是 Master，一名西安交通大学人工智能专业的本科生。</p>
            <p>曾就读于西安交通大学 2023 级少年班。</p>
            <p>主要研究兴趣在 VLA / WAM / SNN 方向。</p>
            <p>爱好有很多。</p>
            <p>喜欢围棋、古典、电影、F1 和 Rusty Lake。</p>
            <p>这是我的 CV，欢迎下载 ～</p>
            <a
              href="/cv.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="not-prose group mt-2 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-foreground/20 hover:bg-muted/80 hover:text-foreground"
            >
              <svg
                class="size-5"
                width="22"
                height="22"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
                set:html={`<g fill="none"><path d="m12.593 23.258l-.011.002l-.071.035l-.02.004l-.014-.004l-.071-.035q-.016-.005-.024.005l-.004.01l-.017.428l.005.02l.01.013l.104.074l.015.004l.012-.004l.104-.074l.012-.016l.004-.017l-.017-.427q-.004-.016-.017-.018m.265-.113l-.013.002l-.185.093l-.01.01l-.003.011l.018.43l.005.012l.008.007l.201.093q.019.005.029-.008l.004-.014l-.034-.614q-.005-.018-.02-.022m-.715.002a.02.02 0 0 0-.027.006l-.006.014l-.034.614q.001.018.017.024l.015-.002l.201-.093l.01-.008l.004-.011l.017-.43l-.003-.012l-.01-.01z"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a1 1 0 0 1 .993.883L13 3v10.586l2.293-2.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.32-.083l.094.083a1 1 0 0 1 .083 1.32l-.083.094l-4 4a1 1 0 0 1-1.32.083l-.094-.083l-4-4a1 1 0 0 1 1.32-1.497l.094.083L11 13.586V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1M5 18a1 1 0 0 1 .993.883L6 19v1a1 1 0 0 0 .883.993L7 21h10a1 1 0 0 0 .993-.883L18 20v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1.993-.117L20 19v1a3 3 0 0 1-2.824 2.995L17 23H7a3 3 0 0 1-2.995-2.824L4 20v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1"/></g>`}
              />
              <span>下载 CV</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div data-lang-en>
            <Content />
          </div>
          <div data-lang-zh>
            <ZhContent />
          </div>

          <h2 id="tools">Tools</h2>
          <p>
            <span data-lang-en>Here are some tools I use every day:</span>
            <span data-lang-zh>以下是我正在使用的一些工具：</span>
          </p>
          <Tools />

          <h2 id="social-networks">Social Networks</h2>
          <p>
            <span data-lang-en>You can find me on these platforms:</span>
            <span data-lang-zh>你可以在以下平台找到我：</span>
          </p>
          <SocialNetworks />

          <h2 id="copyright">Copyright</h2>
          <div data-lang-en>
            <p>
              Unless otherwise stated, all original content and site design are
              licensed under the
              <a
                href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a
              >
              license. You are free to share, copy or adapt the work within the
              license scope, as long as you give appropriate credit and <strong
                >do not use it for commercial purposes</strong
              >.
            </p>
            <p>
              Images, icons, trademarks and other third-party materials used on
              this site belong to their respective rights holders, whether or
              not a © or ™ is shown. No copyright infringement is intended — if
              you believe any content here infringes your rights, please
              contact me and I will remove it promptly.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div data-lang-zh>
            <p>
              除特别说明外，本站所有原创内容与页面设计均采用
              <a
                href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a
              >
              许可协议。在协议范围内你可以自由地分享、复制或改编本站内容，只需注明出处，且<strong
                >不得用于商业用途</strong
              >。
            </p>
            <p>
              本站使用的图片、图标、商标等第三方素材，其版权均归各自权利人所有，无论是否标注 ©
              或 ™。本站无意侵犯任何人的版权；若你认为本站内容侵犯了你的权益，请联系我，我会尽快删除。
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 id="theme">Theme</h2>
          <div data-lang-en>
            <p>
              This blog is built with <a
                href="https://astro.build/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a
              > and <a
                href="https://tailwindcss.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Tailwind CSS</a
              >, starting from the <a
                href="https://github.com/satnaing/astro-paper"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">AstroPaper</a
              > theme and heavily customized since: the layout, typography and
              navigation are reworked following <a
                href="https://axi404.com"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">axi404</a
              >'s style; components such as Algorithm, Theorem, Tools and Social
              Networks were written for this site; comments and page views are
              powered by a self-hosted <a
                href="https://waline.js.org/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Waline</a
              >; and the site supports a Chinese/English switch, Pagefind search
              and per-article LaTeX rendering.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div data-lang-zh>
            <p>
              本站使用 <a
                href="https://astro.build/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a
              >
              与 <a
                href="https://tailwindcss.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Tailwind CSS</a
              >
              构建，从 <a
                href="https://github.com/satnaing/astro-paper"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">AstroPaper</a
              > 主题起步并做了大量定制：整体布局、排版与导航参考 <a
                href="https://axi404.com"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">axi404</a
              > 的风格重写；Algorithm、Theorem、Tools、Social Networks
              等组件为本站自行编写；评论与访问量由自建的 <a
                href="https://waline.js.org/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Waline</a
              >
              提供；并支持中英文切换、Pagefind 静态搜索与文章内的 LaTeX 公式渲染。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <TableOfContents
        headings={[
          ...headings,
          { depth: 2, slug: "tools", text: "Tools" },
          { depth: 2, slug: "social-networks", text: "Social Networks" },
          { depth: 2, slug: "copyright", text: "Copyright" },
          { depth: 2, slug: "theme", text: "Theme" },
        ]}
      />
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
